  "title": "Bugfix: Make sure there is actually an S101 header before calling col_set_str() to set protocol to \"S101\"",
  "description": "Make sure that the packet has an S101 header, before setting the protocol name with col_set_str(). Otherwise, all TCP packets on port 9000 may be misidentified as S101 packets.",
